WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
ReadyDorm brings emergency preparation into one mobile-first workflow.

00:02.000 --> 00:04.500
Residents can prepare profiles, contacts, backpacks, and evacuation routes.

00:04.500 --> 00:06.500
During an emergency, SOS alerts, safe check-ins, and route guidance help residents act quickly.

00:06.500 --> 00:08.000
Managers can monitor building status, alerts, sensors, and meeting points from a dashboard.
